@startuml 04_alur_sinkronisasi_realtime_web
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #333333
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCCCCC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0

title Diagram Alur Sinkronisasi Data Realtime & WebSocket (Tanpa Refresh)

actor "Firman (Admin)" as Admin
participant "portofolio-admin\n(Dashboard CMS)" as AdminApp
participant "Express REST API\n(Port 5000 /api/*)" as BackendAPI
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(Supabase Cloud)" as DB
participant "Realtime Engine\n(WebSocket Server)" as RealtimeEngine
participant "portofolio-web\n(React State Manager)" as WebClient
actor "Pengunjung Web" as User

== 1. Inisialisasi Koneksi Realtime saat Pengunjung Membuka Web ==
User -> WebClient: Membuka website portofolio
activate WebClient

WebClient -> DB: Initial fetch data (getProfile, getProjects, getSkills)
activate DB
note over WebClient: Proteksi withTimeout(promise, 3500ms, fallbackData)\nJika database cold-start > 3.5s, otomatis pakai data lokal agar web tidak freeze!
DB --> WebClient: Return data aktif (Status 200 OK)
deactivate DB

WebClient -> RealtimeEngine: Hubungkan WebSocket Channel:\nsupabase.channel('realtime-projects-web')\n.on('postgres_changes', {event: '*', schema: 'public', table: 'projects'}, callback)\n.subscribe()
activate RealtimeEngine
RealtimeEngine --> WebClient: WebSocket Connection Established (CHANNEL_JOINED)

WebClient --> User: Tampilan website siap digunakan
deactivate WebClient

== 2. Admin Mengubah Data di CMS ==
Admin -> AdminApp: Mengubah narasi proyek / status ketersediaan
activate AdminApp
Admin -> AdminApp: Klik tombol "Simpan Perubahan"
AdminApp -> BackendAPI: PUT /api/projects/:id (atau /api/profile)
activate BackendAPI
BackendAPI -> DB: SQL UPDATE (via Supabase client)
activate DB
DB -> DB: Data tersimpan permanen di database
DB --> BackendAPI: Status 200 OK
BackendAPI --> AdminApp: Response JSON success
deactivate BackendAPI
AdminApp --> Admin: Toast notifikasi: "Perubahan berhasil disimpan!"
deactivate AdminApp

== 3. Penyiaran Perubahan secara Realtime (Push Event) ==
DB -> RealtimeEngine: Trigger Internal Database (pg_notify / WAL log)
deactivate DB
RealtimeEngine -> RealtimeEngine: Format event payload (TABLE: projects, EVENT: UPDATE)

RealtimeEngine -->> WebClient: WebSocket Message Push (Event: postgres_changes)\nPayload: {eventType: "UPDATE", new: {title: "...", ...}}
activate WebClient

note over WebClient: Callback realtime terpanggil:\n1. State React di-update dengan nilai baru\n2. Re-render komponen yang terpengaruh saja (ProjectsSection.tsx)\n3. TIDAK memerlukan refresh browser sama sekali!

WebClient --> User: Teks & elemen website berubah secara instan di depan mata pengunjung!
deactivate WebClient

== 4. Proteksi Fallback (Window Focus Event) ==
note over WebClient: Jika koneksi WebSocket sempat terputus saat pengunjung berganti tab browser:\nListener window.addEventListener('focus', loadDynamicData)\nakan otomatis mengambil data terbaru saat tab kembali aktif.

@enduml
